WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.400
Can your students solve this?

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.840
Subtract 5 from both sides.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.560
That leaves 4x equals negative 24.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.640
Now divide both sides by 4.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.060
x equals negative 6.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.240
Check it.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.750
Four times negative 6 is negative 24,

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.800
plus 5 is negative 19.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.100
It works.

